User: In the diagram below, $WXYZ$ is a trapezoid such that $\overline{WX}\parallel \overline{ZY}$ and $\overline{WY}\perp\overline{ZY}$.  If $YZ = 12$, $\tan Z = 1.5$, and $\tan X = 3$, then what is the area of $WXYZ$?

[asy]
pair WW,X,Y,Z;
Z = (0,0);
Y = (12,0);
WW = (12,18);
X= (18,18);
draw(WW--X--Y--Z--WW);
label("$W$",WW,N);
label("$X$",X,N);
label("$Y$",Y,S);
label("$Z$",Z,S);
[/asy]
